    {
      "sequence": 31,
      "event": "sdk_raw_response",
      "payload": {
        "sdk_type": "raw_response_event",
        "data_type": "response.output_text.delta",
        "delta": "it.**Available Pipelines**\n- Public: 13 workflows covering bacterial annotation, AMR/virulence detection, bacterial/viral variants, metagenomics, viral typing, and RNA structure prediction.\n- Internal: 5 educational runtime templates for shell, WDL, Nextflow, "
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-26T07:46:51.876786+00:00"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 32,
      "event": "sdk_raw_response",
      "payload": {
        "sdk_type": "raw_response_event",
        "data_type": "response.output_text.delta",
        "delta": "and Snakemake.\n\n**Best FASTA Annotation Fit**\n- `bacterial_genome_annotation` — intended for assembled bacterial contigs in FASTA format.\n- Required input: `genome` (`.fasta`, `.fa`, or `.fna`).\n- Annotator: Prokka by default; Bakta is selectable.\n- Optional "
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-26T07:46:52.646772+00:00"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 33,
      "event": "sdk_raw_response",
      "payload": {
        "sdk_type": "raw_response_event",
        "data_type": "response.output_text.delta",
        "delta": "metadata: genus, species, strain, locus tag, translation table, Gram status, and related settings.\n- Outputs: GFF, GenBank, proteins, genes, contigs, feature tables, reports, metrics, plots, logs, and archive bundle.\n- Limitation: requires assembled bacterial "
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-26T07:46:53.396241+00:00"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 34,
      "event": "sdk_raw_response",
      "payload": {
        "sdk_type": "raw_response_event",
        "data_type": "response.output_text.delta",
        "delta": "contigs—not raw reads. Quality depends on annotator and database versions.\n\n**Other Annotation Option**\n- `bacterial_functional_annotation` accepts bacterial FASTA or FASTQ and assigns gene functions/orthology terms.\n- Outputs: annotation terms, gene annotations, "
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-26T07:46:53.995997+00:00"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 35,
      "event": "sdk_raw_response",
      "payload": {
        "sdk_type": "raw_response_event",
        "data_type": "response.output_text.delta",
        "delta": "QC, and status.\n- Limitation: does not infer taxonomy, abundance, or biological conclusions.\n\n**Example Data**\n- Staged FASTA: `uploads/examples/bacterial_genome_annotation-dbffbb8c/example_contigs.fasta`\n- No pipeline was planned or "
      },
      "created_at": "2026-09-26T07:46:54.731932+00:00"
    },
